N.2144="label"*105x9<M>
n="Function:  The CountDown Timer begins timing down from an initial value \"Initial Time\" to 0.  
The CountDown Timer begins operating when the \"Reset\" pulse goes high (1).  

Inputs:
Reset:  a pulse input, 1 causes the CountDown Timer to begin operation 
Initial Time:  The Time Value that the CountDown Timer is initialized to when Reset goes high

Outputs: 
TimeToGo:  Remaining time to reach 0, sec
gate: set = 0 after TimeToGo reaches 0, else set = 1

Parameters:
dt is a global variable set to the update time of the model
"
